         Recheck Cond: (p = 3)
         ->  Bitmap Index Scan on q3_ps  (cost=0.00..34.13 rows=1846 width=0)
               Index Cond: (p = 3)
   ->  Hash  (cost=495.02..495.02 rows=340 width=24)
         ->  Hash Join  (cost=245.38..495.02 rows=340 width=24)
               Hash Cond: (a.s = b.s)
               ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on q3 a  (cost=34.60..187.69 rows=1847 width=12)
                     Recheck Cond: (p = 1)
                     ->  Bitmap Index Scan on q3_ps  (cost=0.00..34.14 rows=1847 width=0)
                           Index Cond: (p = 1)
               ->  Hash  (cost=187.69..187.69 rows=1847 width=12)
                     ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on q3 b  (cost=34.60..187.69 rows=1847 width=12)
                           Recheck Cond: (p = 2)
                           ->  Bitmap Index Scan on q3_ps  (cost=0.00..34.14 rows=1847 width=0)
                                 Index Cond: (p = 2)
(18 rows)

-- size: an exact join relation the bgp lines do not cover gets the stated rows,
-- and what is built on it is sized from them (no ratio applied twice).
EXPLAIN (COSTS ON)
